  "path_redaction": "Only the absolute workspace prefix in pinned-terms.log changed, in 5 fields, to <fixture-workspace>. Its source and export hashes are distinct. Every other file is byte-identical to its source commit. The traces are published as recorded: the program_artifacts section of 4 of them names the three program binaries by their absolute paths on the machine that ran them.",
  "source_files": "The six files under source/ are the build inputs that differ between the base commit and the program_source commit, copied byte for byte. Their SHA-256 values equal the entries for the same paths in the traces' build_inputs. The other 63 build inputs are identical to the files under ../source/. The files retain their existing copyright, and this release adds no license grant for them."
